:"original","quote":"田畴曰：“邢颙，民之先觉也。”乃见太祖，求为乡导，以克柳城","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":259,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":114,"end":143,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"cuimao-q2-d2539b23436915829033","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-fcee2600a748b8b0406a","layer":"original","quote":"邢颙，字子昂，河间鄚人也〖1〗。举孝廉，司徒辟，皆不就。易姓字，适右北平，从田畴游。积五年，而太祖定冀州；颙谓畴曰：“黄巾起来二十余年〖2〗，海内鼎沸，百姓流离。今闻曹公法令严；民厌乱矣，乱极则平：请以身先。”遂装还乡里〖3〗。田畴曰：“邢颙，民之先觉也。”乃见太祖，求为乡导，以克柳城。","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":259,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":144,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o109a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-941e466279df6c3bb760","layer":"original","quote":"三郡乌丸承天下乱〖6〗，破幽州〖7〗，略有汉民合十余万户。袁绍皆立其酋豪为单于；以家人子为己女〖8〗，妻焉。辽西单于蹋顿尤强〖9〗，为绍所厚〖10〗。故尚兄弟归之，数入塞为害。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":600,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":88,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o109b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-941e466279df6c3bb760","layer":"original","quote":"三郡乌丸承天下乱〖6〗，破幽州〖7〗，略有汉民合十余万户。袁绍皆立其酋豪为单于；以家人子为己女〖8〗，妻焉。辽西单于蹋顿尤强〖9〗，为绍所厚〖10〗。故尚兄弟归之，数入塞为害。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":600,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":88,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o114b-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-450f7815dc8f8edb5b1d","layer":"original","quote":"未至二百里，虏乃知之。尚、熙与蹋顿、辽西单于楼班、右北平单于能臣抵之等〖10〗，将数万骑逆军。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":633,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":87,"end":134,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-e-o115a-q","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1a17e5b34add834e2d76","layer":"original","quote":"八月，登白狼山〖11〗，猝与虏遇〖12〗。众甚盛。公车重在后，被甲者少〖13〗；左右皆惧。公登高，望虏阵不整，乃纵兵击之，使张辽为先锋；虏众大崩；斩蹋顿及名王以下〖14〗，胡、汉降者二十余万口。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":634,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":97,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-b-fbc277caaf5ad8b958df","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-fbc277caaf5ad8b958df","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗十二年：建安十二年（公元 207）。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":623,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-20efb4f3aff50357a189","start":0,"end":21,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o109","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-941e466279df6c3bb760","layer":"original","quote":"三郡乌丸承天下乱〖6〗，破幽州〖7〗，略有汉民合十余万户。袁绍皆立其酋豪为单于；以家人子为己女〖8〗，妻焉。辽西单于蹋顿尤强〖9〗，为绍所厚〖10〗。故尚兄弟归之，数入塞为害。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":600,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":88,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o111","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-01eaf58b917a530c61d5","layer":"original","quote":"十二年春二月〖1〗，公自淳于还邺。丁酉〖2〗，令曰：“吾起义兵诛暴乱，于今十九年；所征必克，岂吾功哉？乃贤士大夫之力也！天下虽未悉定，吾当要与贤士大夫共定之；而专享其劳〖3〗，吾何以安焉？其促定功行封〖4〗。”于是大封功臣二十余人，皆为列侯；其余各以次受封；及复死事之孤〖5〗：轻重各有差〖6〗。﹝一﹞","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":621,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":151,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o114","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-450f7815dc8f8edb5b1d","layer":"original","quote":"秋七月，大水，傍海道不通；田畴请为乡导〖3〗，公从之。引军出卢龙塞〖4〗，塞外道绝不通。乃堑山堙谷五百余里〖5〗，经白檀〖6〗，历平冈〖7〗；涉鲜卑庭〖8〗，东指柳城〖9〗。未至二百里，虏乃知之。尚、熙与蹋顿、辽西单于楼班、右北平单于能臣抵之等〖10〗，将数万骑逆军。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":633,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":134,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o115","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-1a17e5b34add834e2d76","layer":"original","quote":"八月，登白狼山〖11〗，猝与虏遇〖12〗。众甚盛。公车重在后，被甲者少〖13〗；左右皆惧。公登高，望虏阵不整，乃纵兵击之，使张辽为先锋；虏众大崩；斩蹋顿及名王以下〖14〗，胡、汉降者二十余万口。辽东单于速仆丸及辽西、北平诸豪〖15〗，弃其种人〖16〗，与尚、熙奔辽东〖17〗，众尚有数千骑。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":634,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":145,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-01e7260df0e6bb313a67","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-228521c23fcc33c40b25","layer":"original","quote":"蹋顿遣使诣绍求和亲","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":43,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":73,"end":82,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-1b9d3c0a0627d456e821","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-ae68c64cc471b15b9686","layer":"original","quote":"太祖潜师北伐，出其不意，一战而定之；夷狄慑服，威振朔土","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":94,"end":121,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-1bf57ac8e49244c74fef","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-228521c23fcc33c40b25","layer":"original","quote":"助绍击瓒，破之","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":43,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":83,"end":90,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-1d87cf81b5b722ccc7eb","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-2f1cc72774f57473ed30","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝一﹞《英雄记》曰：“绍遣使，即拜乌丸三王为单于，皆安车、华盖、羽旄、黄屋、左纛；版文曰：‘使持节、大将军、督幽青并、领冀州牧、（阮）〔邟〕乡侯绍，承制诏辽东属国率众王颁下、乌丸辽西率众王蹋顿、右北平率众王汗卢：维乃祖慕义迁善，款塞内附；北捍狁，东拒濊貊；世守北陲，为百姓保障。虽时侵犯王略，命将徂征厥罪；率不旋时，悔愆变改。方之外夷，最（又）〔为〕聪惠者也。始有千夫长、百夫长以相统领，用能悉乃心，克有勋力于国家，稍受王侯之命。自我王室多故，公孙瓒作难，残夷厥土之君，以侮天慢主；是以四海之内，并执干戈以卫社稷。三王奋气裔土，忿奸忧国，控弦与汉兵为表里：诚甚忠孝，朝所嘉焉。然而虎兕长蛇，相随塞路；王官爵命，否而无闻。夫有勋不赏，俾勤者怠；今遣行谒者杨林，赍单于玺绶车服，以对尔劳。其各绥静部落，教以谨慎，无使作凶作慝；世复尔祀位，长为百蛮长。厥有咎有不臧者，泯于尔禄，而丧于乃庸。可不勉乎！乌桓单于都护部众，左右单于受其节度；他如故事。’”","attribution":"裴注引《英雄记》","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":61,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-210a24522097fb688ed6","start":0,"end":422,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-3575dddede24f50821df","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-228521c23fcc33c40b25","layer":"original","quote":"后楼班大，峭王率其部众奉楼班为单于；蹋顿为王，然蹋顿多画计策","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":43,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":122,"end":152,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-7625f1f46d5e5feae55b","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-228521c23fcc33c40b25","layer":"original","quote":"从子蹋顿有武略，代立；总摄三王部，众皆从其教令","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":43,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":38,"end":61,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-7a5cb6eb577a5348a013","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-ae68c64cc471b15b9686","layer":"original","quote":"其后尚、熙又逃于蹋顿","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":3,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":37,"end":47,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-7dd8994935c6805db46c","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-228521c23fcc33c40b25","layer":"original","quote":"灵帝末，以刘虞为幽州牧〖2〗；募胡斩纯首，北州乃定。后丘力居死，子楼班年小。从子蹋顿有武略，代立；总摄三王部，众皆从其教令。袁绍与公孙瓒连战不决；蹋顿遣使诣绍求和亲，助绍击瓒，破之。绍矫制赐蹋顿、（难）峭王、汗鲁王印绶〖3〗，皆以为单于。﹝一﹞后楼班大，峭王率其部众奉楼班为单于；蹋顿为王，然蹋顿多画计策。","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":43,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":153,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-9f1914e5afeafd25f8ac","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-0b259fc94780e0681fd2","layer":"original","quote":"后袁尚败奔蹋顿，凭其势，复图冀州","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":44,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":56,"end":72,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-a7365f0d45ef197d3704","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-2a3e7083cec67ed88076","layer":"original","quote":"建安十（一）〔二〕年，太祖自征蹋顿于柳城；潜军诡道〖9〗，未至百余里，虏乃觉。尚与蹋顿将众逆战于凡城〖10〗，兵马甚盛。太祖登高，望虏阵，（柳）〔抑〕军未进；观其小动，乃击破其众；临阵斩蹋顿首，死者被野","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":45,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":101,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wuhuan-q-bb40d3342e66bd8e649a","section":"chapter-030","block":"b-228521c23fcc33c40b25","layer":"original","quote":"绍矫制赐蹋顿、（难）峭王、汗鲁王印绶〖3〗，皆以为单于","section_title":"乌丸鲜卑东夷传第三十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0066.xhtml","index":43,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":91,"end":118,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-e-o033b-q","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-7bb3311908283b52f710","layer":"original","quote":"及北征三郡，纯部骑获单于蹋顿。以前后功封高陵亭侯，邑三百户。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":156,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":126,"end":156,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xiahoucao-q-o033","section":"chapter-009","block":"b-7bb3311908283b52f710","layer":"original","quote":"仁弟纯。﹝一﹞初以议郎参司空军事〖1〗。督虎、豹骑从围南皮〖2〗，袁谭出战；士卒多死，太祖欲缓之。纯曰：“今千里蹈敌，进不能克，退必丧威；且悬师深入〖3〗，难以持久。彼胜而骄，我败而惧；以惧敌骄，必可克也！”太祖善其言，遂急攻之；谭败，纯麾下骑斩谭首。及北征三郡，纯部骑获单于蹋顿。以前后功封高陵亭侯，邑三百户。从征荆州，追刘备于长坂〖4〗；获其二女、辎重，收其散卒。进降江陵，从还谯。","section_title":"诸夏侯曹传第九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0023.xhtml","index":156,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":193,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-0fe6aac28fd2583f8d1f","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-12c592fb65c1e837ed4b","layer":"original","quote":"太祖令畴将其众为乡导，上徐无山，出卢龙，历平冈，登白狼堆","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":278,"end":306,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-45ec1ef7188ccff17ffb","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-12c592fb65c1e837ed4b","layer":"original","quote":"时方夏，水雨，而滨海洿下〖8〗，泞滞不通；虏亦遮守蹊要〖9〗，军不得进","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":35,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-5efa41d4716cdb95cd7c","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-12c592fb65c1e837ed4b","layer":"original","quote":"乃引军还，而署大木表于水侧路傍曰〖15〗：“方今暑（夏）〔雨〕，道路不通；且俟秋冬，乃复进军。”虏候骑见之〖16〗，诚以为大军去也","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":212,"end":277,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-6e1523aa8e9ef53db85e","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-12c592fb65c1e837ed4b","layer":"original","quote":"太祖患之，以问畴。畴曰：“此道，秋夏每常有水；浅不通车马，深不载舟船，为难久矣！旧北平郡治在平冈〖10〗，道出卢龙，达于柳城；自建武以来〖11〗，陷坏断绝，垂二百载〖12〗，而尚有微径可从。今虏将以大军当由无终，不得进而退，懈弛无备。若默回军，从卢龙口越白檀之险〖13〗，出空虚之地，路近而便；掩其不备，蹋顿之首可不战而擒也〖14〗。”太祖曰：“善！”","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":36,"end":212,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"yuanzhang-q-f07b52453e2f5ec01671","section":"chapter-011","block":"b-12c592fb65c1e837ed4b","layer":"original","quote":"去柳城二百余里，虏乃惊觉。单于身自临阵，太祖与交战；遂大斩获，追奔逐北，至柳城","section_title":"袁张凉国田王邴管传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0027.xhtml","index":212,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":307,"end":346,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-e-o005a-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-5f877be849f750b12973","layer":"original","quote":"从征袁尚于柳城，猝与虏遇；辽劝太祖战，气甚奋。太祖壮之，自以所持麾授辽〖8〗；遂击，大破之，斩单于蹋顿。﹝一﹞","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":5,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-q-o005","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-5f877be849f750b12973","layer":"original","quote":"从征袁尚于柳城，猝与虏遇；辽劝太祖战，气甚奋。太祖壮之，自以所持麾授辽〖8〗；遂击，大破之，斩单于蹋顿。﹝一﹞","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":5,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-q-o040","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-e7ed3fa863e93b8dd8f5","layer":"original","quote":"太祖授晃兵，使击卷、﹝一﹞原武贼〖1〗；破之，拜裨将军。从征吕布，别降布将赵庶、李邹等。与史涣斩眭固于河内。从破刘备。又从破颜良，拔白马；进至延津，破文丑，拜偏将军。与曹洪击！强贼祝臂，破之。又与史涣击袁绍运车于故市〖2〗，功最多，封都亭侯〖3〗。太祖既围邺，破邯郸。易阳令韩范，伪以城降而拒守，太祖遣晃攻之。晃至，飞矢城中，为陈成败；范悔，晃辄降之〖4〗。既而言于太祖曰：“二袁未破，诸城未下者倾耳而听；今日灭易阳〖5〗，明日皆以死守：恐河北无定时也。愿公降易阳以示诸诚，则莫不望风。”太祖善之。别讨毛城，设伏兵掩击，破三屯。从破袁谭于南皮，讨平原叛贼，克之。从征蹋顿，拜横野将军〖6〗。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":145,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":295,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
